<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Research Log | Taeuk Im</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #0b0b0b;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ---------- TOP NAV ---------- */
    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-inner a {
      color: #d0d0d0;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .nav-inner a:hover,
    .nav-inner a.active {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* ---------- PAGE LAYOUT ---------- */
    .page {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .content-inner {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 920px;
    }

    .content-inner h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 44px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #d0d0d0;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 0 56px;
    }

    /* ---------- LOG LIST ---------- */
    .log-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .log-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 28px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    }

    .log-card:last-child {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    }

    .log-thumb {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #161616;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .log-thumb img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 140px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .log-meta {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #9a9a9a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .log-title {
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .log-title a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .log-title a:hover {
      color: #ffb7a5;
    }

    .log-desc {
      color: #b5b5b5;
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      max-width: 680px;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #d0d0d0;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .log-links {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .log-links a {
      color: #ffb7a5;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .log-links a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .dot {
      margin: 0 10px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    }

    footer {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 120px auto 0;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
    }

    /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .content-inner h2 {
        font-size: 38px;
      }

      .log-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .log-thumb img {
        height: auto;
        max-height: 320px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .page {
        padding-top: 56px;
      }

      .nav-inner {
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .nav-inner a {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .content-inner h2 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      .intro {
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="research-log.html" class="active">Research Log</a>
      <a href="projects.html">Projects</a>
      <a href="experience.html">Experience</a>
      <a href="publications.html">Publications</a>
      <a href="honors.html">Honors & Awards</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="page">
    <section class="content">
      <div class="content-inner">

        <h2>Research Log</h2>

        <p class="intro">
          A collection of small simulations, technical notes, and implementation records
          from my preparation for research in satellite-terrestrial networks,
          optimization, reinforcement learning, and space-based computing systems.
        </p>

        <div class="log-list">

          <article class="log-card">
            <a class="log-thumb" href="research-log/kaist-satellite-visibility.html">
              <img src="assets/research-log/kaist-satellite-visibility.gif" alt="Satellite visibility simulation from KAIST">
            </a>

            <div>
              <div class="log-meta">May 2026 · Simulation</div>

              <h3 class="log-title">
                <a href="research-log/kaist-satellite-visibility.html">
                  Visualizing Satellite Visibility from KAIST
                </a>
              </h3>

              <p class="log-desc">
                A small simulation that checks which satellites are visible from KAIST over time.
                This is an initial step toward studying time-varying connectivity,
                satellite selection, computation offloading, and resource allocation
                in satellite-terrestrial integrated networks.
              </p>

              <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">Satellite Visibility</span>
                <span class="tag">Orbital Simulation</span>
                <span class="tag">Python</span>
                <span class="tag">LEO Networks</span>
              </div>

              <div class="log-links">
                <a href="research-log/kaist-satellite-visibility.html">Read note</a>
                <span class="dot">·</span>
                <a href="https://github.com/taeuk97" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Taeuk Im · Aerospace Communications & Applied Intelligence (ACAI) Lab @ KAIST
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
